{"id":"904f367f2b11cda0","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-term-graph.md","title":"有序开放项图","display":"df-term-graph — 有序开放项图","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","type":"definition","label":"56-df-term-graph","aliases":["56-df-term-graph"],"display":"df-term-graph — 有序开放项图","depends_on":["[[56-df-signature]]"],"source_section":"§13.2 Definition 13.2.1","source_printed_pages":"714","source_ocr_blocks":[735],"source_verification":"本地DjVu OCR陈述已比对；本笔记编码、推导与核验限制见Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-term-graph"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-term-graph</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-term-graph — 有序开放项图"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"53c31cee4a64d821\" href=\"?note=53c31cee4a64d821\" title=\"56-df-signature\">56-df-signature</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§13.2 Definition 13.2.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"714"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>735</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"本地DjVu OCR陈述已比对；本笔记编码、推导与核验限制见Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar})\">\\(\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar})\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"53c31cee4a64d821\" href=\"?note=53c31cee4a64d821\" title=\"56-df-signature\">56-df-signature</a> 的签名；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 为集合参数。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(N^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 表示有限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> 元素序列集；序列坐标从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 起，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|q|\">\\(|q|\\)</span> 表示长度，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"()\">\\(()\\)</span> 是空序列。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{TermGraph}(\\Sigma,G)\\iff\n\\exists N\\,\\exists a\\,\\exists D\\,\\exists\\lambda\\,\\exists r\\;\\bigl(&amp;\nG=(N,a,\\lambda,r)\\land r\\in N\\land D\\subseteq N\\\\\n&amp;\\land a\\in(N^{&lt;\\omega})^N\\land\\lambda\\in\\mathcal F^D\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in D\\;|a(n)|=\\operatorname{ar}(\\lambda(n))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in N\\setminus D\\;a(n)=()\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{TermGraph}(\\Sigma,G)\\iff\n\\exists N\\,\\exists a\\,\\exists D\\,\\exists\\lambda\\,\\exists r\\;\\bigl(&amp;\nG=(N,a,\\lambda,r)\\land r\\in N\\land D\\subseteq N\\\\\n&amp;\\land a\\in(N^{&lt;\\omega})^N\\land\\lambda\\in\\mathcal F^D\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in D\\;|a(n)|=\\operatorname{ar}(\\lambda(n))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in N\\setminus D\\;a(n)=()\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>分量顺序采用原书的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(N,\\mathrm{args},\\mathrm{label},\\mathrm{root})\">\\((N,\\mathrm{args},\\mathrm{label},\\mathrm{root})\\)</span>；标签是部分函数，未标号节点必须为叶节点。出边以序列保留次序和重数，因而同一节点可同时作为多个参数，也允许循环。这里忠实保留定义13.2.1的范围，不暗中要求节点有限、无环或全部可从根到达。后续文件将通过分量解构绑定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_G,a_G,\\lambda_G,r_G\">\\(N_G,a_G,\\lambda_G,r_G\\)</span>，并单独给出根可达条件。</p>\n<p>已比对原书定义的四个分量及两种出度条件；这是一个集合论谓词，不需要为所有候选参数预设图存在。</p>\n<p>来源：用户提供的本地 Terese (2003) DjVu；OCR页块序号为提取文本块标识，不等同于物理扫描页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"53c31cee4a64d821","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-signature]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"53c31cee4a64d821","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar})$ 为 [[56-df-signature]] 的签名；$G$ 为集合参数。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar})","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"N^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"N","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"|q|","display":false},{"tex":"()","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{TermGraph}(\\Sigma,G)\\iff\n\\exists N\\,\\exists a\\,\\exists D\\,\\exists\\lambda\\,\\exists r\\;\\bigl(&\nG=(N,a,\\lambda,r)\\land r\\in N\\land D\\subseteq N\\\\\n&\\land a\\in(N^{<\\omega})^N\\land\\lambda\\in\\mathcal F^D\\\\\n&\\land\\forall n\\in D\\;|a(n)|=\\operatorname{ar}(\\lambda(n))\\\\\n&\\land\\forall n\\in N\\setminus D\\;a(n)=()\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"(N,\\mathrm{args},\\mathrm{label},\\mathrm{root})","display":false},{"tex":"N_G,a_G,\\lambda_G,r_G","display":false}],"bytes":1816,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a4fa7874f12cc27","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$G=(N_G,a_G,\\lambda_G,r_G)$ 满足 $\\operatorname{TermGraph}(\\Sigma,G)$，见 [[56-df-term-graph]]；这些下标记号为该结构的四个分量。"},{"id":"9a89c52b489c33b7","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$G=(N_G,a_G,\\lambda_G,r_G)$、$H=(N_H,a_H,\\lambda_H,r_H)$ 是同一签名 $\\Sigma$ 上的项图，见 [[56-df-term-graph]]。"},{"id":"1c088d04d4303598","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$G=(N_G,a_G,\\lambda_G,r_G)$ 满足 [[56-df-term-graph]] 的 $\\operatorname{TermGraph}(\\Sigma,G)$，$\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar})$。"},{"id":"4a9c89b3e42d1880","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar})$；$G=(N_G,a_G,\\lambda_G,r_G)$、$H=(N_H,a_H,\\lambda_H,r_H)$ 满足 [[56-df-term-graph]] 的 $\\operatorname{TermGraph}$。"},{"id":"ec93c08d698f2539","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-345","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-term-graph.md]]"},{"id":"faf9dd8d1400edec","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$G=(N_G,a_G,\\lambda_G,r_G)$、$H=(N_H,a_H,\\lambda_H,r_H)$ 满足 [[56-df-term-graph]] 的同签名项图条件。"},{"id":"e42d17d6f02097e2","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$G=(N_G,a_G,\\lambda_G,r_G)$ 满足 [[56-df-term-graph]] 的 $\\operatorname{TermGraph}(\\Sigma,G)$。"}],"outgoing":["53c31cee4a64d821"]}